  "fullDescription": "Add a festive touch to your holiday style with these 3D Printable Christmas Tree Earrings! This elegant matching pair features beautifully sculpted Christmas tree silhouettes with intricate swirling filigree patterns, layered ornamental details, and graceful decorative curves.\n\nDesigned as statement holiday earrings, these lightweight-looking decorative pieces combine Christmas charm with an elegant ornamental style. The detailed openwork pattern creates visual depth while keeping the design sophisticated and eye-catching. They are perfect for Christmas outfits, holiday parties, festive events, handmade jewelry projects, or seasonal gifts.\n\nWhat You Will Receive:\nHigh-Resolution STL File of the Christmas Tree Earrings\nMatching pair of decorative Christmas tree earring designs\nIntricate filigree and scrollwork details\nDecorative hanging loop design\nElegant openwork Christmas tree silhouette\nDigital 3D printable jewelry model\nPrinting & Technical Recommendations:\nFile Format: STL\nCompatibility: Suitable for FDM and Resin 3D printers\nFilament Suggestion: Use lightweight PLA or other suitable jewelry-printing materials\nSupports: Supports may be required depending on printer type, orientation, and settings\nPrint Settings: A finer layer height is recommended to preserve the intricate ornamental details\nAssembly: Add your preferred earring hooks, jump rings, or findings after printing\nScalability: Scale carefully while maintaining the small decorative details and earring proportions\nIdeal For:\nChristmas jewelry\nHoliday earrings\nFestive accessories\nChristmas outfits\nHoliday parties\nHandmade jewelry projects\n3D printed accessories\nChristmas gifts\nDIY jewelry making\nSeasonal fashion accessories\nElegant festive styling\nCreative jewelry collections\n\n(Note: This is an instant digital download containing an STL file for 3D printing. No physical jewelry or earring findings will be shipped.)",
